	<!-- Post 2 -->
	<item>
		<title>10 Essential Tips for Modern Web Design</title>
		<link>http://localhost/10-essential-tips-web-design/</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 08 Sep 2026 00:02:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Md Shammir Ahmed]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://localhost/?p=1002</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Web design is constantly evolving, but the core principles remain the same. Here are the top 10 tips to ensure your website stands out in 2026:</p><ol><li><strong>Prioritize Mobile-First:</strong> More than 60% of traffic comes from mobile devices. Make sure your layout fluidly adapts.</li><li><strong>Keep it Fast:</strong> Optimize images, minify CSS/JS, and use a reliable caching plugin.</li><li><strong>Accessible Colors:</strong> Ensure high contrast ratios for text to background.</li><li><strong>White Space is Your Friend:</strong> Don't clutter your layout. Let the content breathe.</li><li><strong>Clear Typography:</strong> Stick to two fonts maximum to maintain a clean aesthetic.</li></ol>]]></content:encoded>
